# Discovery UI methodology

Read **`docs/SYSTEM_COHERENCE.md` §6.1** before adding map peek UI.

## When to use “explore”

Only for the **surface**: `/explore`, `ExploreMapStage`, explore API/routing helpers. **Never** prefix entity peek components with `Explore` or `Explore*Peek*`.

## Three layers (do not invent a fourth prefix)

| Layer | Name pattern | Example |
|-------|----------------|---------|
| L1 Card VM | `DiscoveryCard*` | `buildDiscoveryCardViewModel` |
| L2 Map peek | `MapPeekShell` (shared chrome once) + `{Entity}Peek*` | `ActivityPeekCard`, `PlacePeekBody` |
| L3 Detail | `*DetailPage`, entity modules | `HikingActivityDetailPage` |

**Not** `PinSummary*` on every file — that was a mistake. One shell: **`MapPeekShell`**. Everything else: **`{Entity}Peek*`** under `peek/{activity|place|area|shop}/`.

## Geography (Place · venue · Area · facility)

| Term | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| **Place** | Catalog entity (`locations`) — UI: `PlacePeek*` |
| **`venue`** | Wire only: `card.source === 'venue'` (Place on Spots lens) |
| **Area** | Hub pin `source: 'area'` — UI: `AreaPeek*` |
| **Facility** | Amenity **Place**; area rollup `facilities` — not an Area type |

Looking-for / seeking = **activity** (`activityMode: seeking`); publisher = **organizer** on wire — same `ActivityPeekCard` / `resolveActivityPeekEngagement` as hosted outings. **Legacy intent-only** rows: `ActivityPeekHostManageActions` + `showLegacySeekingOwnerPeek` (not `DemandOwner*` UI).

`*MapPeekHost` = **map mount** (overlay/sheet), not organizer vocabulary.

## Routing

`map-peek/mapPeekSlots.tsx` — **only** place that branches on `card.source` for the activity map peek host.

## Legacy

No `Explore*Peek*` files under `src/explore/ui/` — CI fails if any appear. No `ExploreVenuePeek*`, `ExploreDemandOwner*`, or `PinSummary*` sprawl.

Guards: `mapPeekNaming.test.ts`, `discoveryUiMethodologyGuard.test.ts`, `geographyTerminologyGuard.test.ts`.
